      "sourceTextSha256": "74e08977af0333b02f7f1e646807f8beed2de4685934b7729d6d08f9ba427218",
      "text": "This 11-day itinerary combines Panama City and the Panama Canal, a visit to an Emberá community, the Pacific coast, the mountain region of Boquete, Barú Volcano and the Caribbean waters around Bocas del Toro. The trip includes city tours, a ride in a traditional indigenous canoe, a canopy tour above the jungle, a coffee plantation, a 4x4 ascent of the volcano and several free days by the sea.",
